[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_IN_THE_STREET]
In the Streets

[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_IN_THE_STREET_desc]
Manehattan, Hooflyn, Fillydelphia... The cries and wails of ponies are everywhere.\n\nOur agents will penetrate into every streets and every alleys, reaching out to the ponies in distress, giving them the courage and strength to resist.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_IN_THE_STREET]
大街小巷之中

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_IN_THE_STREET_desc]
马哈顿、蹄林城、小马德菲亚... 那是小马们的呼唤、哀嚎。\n\n我们的特工会走进大街小巷，向苦难中的小马们伸出援蹄，给他们反抗的勇气与力量。

